Taxa present in fewer than 10% of samples and those with mean abundance below the overall mean abundance across taxa were excluded. Associations between species abundance and kidney function (eGFR) or CKD progression (eGFR slope) were assessed using general linear models (GLMs):\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
